# Run artefacts. Kept on disk, out of git.
*.log
*.pid
*.bak
*.out

# Session diagnostics. Every _*.py here is a one-off written to answer a
# single question during development -- feasibility probes, dual dumps,
# constraint scans, sweeps. They are kept because several document how a
# defect was actually found, but they are not part of the study and several
# hard-code paths or assume a solved model in the current directory.
_*.py

# Transient run state: a list of cases awaiting retry, and a driver script
# that hardcodes the old Desktop path this study lived at before the move.
retry.txt
finish.sh

# Solver output and caches
*.json.gz
results/
